    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8790f26f86dcc0b13eabf093",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "包含气槽和菱亚马逊在内，\n这里有许多一同创造狂热的\n赛马娘们的照片。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd5a869dd601fc4f096bc38321b762e72d3e49f5596eeac0b7dd4db3039b0e99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
