      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，不过气槽的实力\n应该足以和她们对抗吧？\n毕竟她曾在“天皇赏（秋）”中获胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4958a4664b3eb726c3032754a1f5021d6a164127c78636fea41a697f493558e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
