    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b9899bcea8dfd2c8899efc4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她之后在“有马纪念”中，\n将第一名拱手让给了\n在经典三冠中连一冠都没拿到的选手吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab792afa7913f1735f0c22c88013a17a278fd982239446860d19cde1982208ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
