    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f6ac65965cd60f70c4e46d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋天的那场胜利确实很特别。\n但她在古马级就只有赢那一场……\n果然“就是这样”吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c05a6eca0f93499a63f31401d85b50a13307b7fc85d013f210e0e50eb9d35a90",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044115.json",
      "json_path": [
