    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d1ba6a22d321617fff9a799",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是经过历史证明的事实。\n果然还是只有从经典三冠路线\n脱颖而出的赛马娘配得上“最强”的称号！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fb41b8c6941c015f7528f4b2eb7cec48e222d8ebc034d8597f0e53741bd9b0e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4a6b32c4d81ad8fe9d3d9f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──经典三冠路线和\n三后冠路线需要的资质和能力，\n原本就不同。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a61c00a8acd5af61be1b7673224e3d1245a219537be523cc1892a544835c4ea4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044115.json",
      "json_path": [
