      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d96e2a61f7d7f0c5d1731ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以不能一概而论地\n断定“孰优孰劣”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad635e29c3e304230052f6cf5f4d7b5f17057cc4e9f8dd60eebab591b26c9cf4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a54bba7aa2bf89a1eb12feb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在日本的竞赛中，经典三冠是\n最早的“三冠”，拥有悠久的历史。\n而且需要能应付各种竞赛距离的能力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83235b8874def253e7886ddff3291dfb98e778903f76edd65af28c2e78421be0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dab9d67a7f7a38602812db04",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那些客人刚才说\n“三冠路线的赛马娘，\n实力比后冠路线的赛马娘强”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ba081c98a17a16e6d5bb8729784c798440896e7ec599d17ad639ff51f7ffa3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6e120d700ee81b3bec19563",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "确实是有这样的说法，\n而累积至今的竞赛结果印证了这个说法……\n这也是事实。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d09d9c248779820196a20f4a8da7fc4e13d800f60de201b87303cd1cc7cd962",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d374131ca9b32bfe0dd88a01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那些客人讨论的期间，\n东商变革她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d82528827c52fab1700634114b070bb6cbac583fd485d9ee8e1bef8a9209a78e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
