    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5906874d38e6d9f18eba0aeb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她说完便突然跑出展览会场，\n然后一回到训练员室，\n就开始以惊人的气势翻阅资料！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65a5c59be4059d376f833a2f379a0a84142f303061f4fd943ba5f4a9ce69aa26",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
